        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073530/extras/0e22010544bb476b63c2f54812d1bfea.avif?t=1766444513\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Incursion</i> is a sci-fi take on the classic horde survival game. Set in the near future, you’ll fight as a soldier of R.A.I.D. (Regional Anti-Incursion Defense). Unlock new classes and abilities as you battle an unrelenting swarm. Can you rise up and become a master of the battlefield?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073530/extras/13e2fda1f7667b44ed49c3f52af667d2.poster.avif?t=1766444513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073530/extras/13e2fda1f7667b44ed49c3f52af667d2.webm?t=1766444513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073530/extras/13e2fda1f7667b44ed49c3f52af667d2.mp4?t=1766444513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Unique Classes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18  Abilities that can be upgraded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 Regions/Environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4073530/extras/6e90ef08777853fed69b20ebcd364520.poster.avif?t=1766444513\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com